{
    "title": "Rival Stars Horse Racing",
    "description": "<font color=\"\u201dnavy\u201d\">Enjoy the ultimate horse racing and riding experience on mobile</font>\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfc7 <b>RACE</b> \ud83c\udfc7\r\n\u2605 Compete for glory in thrilling horse races\r\n\u2605 Immersive racing gameplay with motion-captured animations and realistic commentary\r\n\u2605 Team up with your friends and claim your place on the global leaderboard in live events\r\n\u2605 Customize your jockey, silks, and helmets for a photo finish\r\n\r\n\ud83e\uddec <b>BREED</b> \ud83e\uddec\r\n\u2605 Breed adorable foals with unique coats and patterns\r\n\u2605 Detailed genetic horse breeding system and distinct horse breeds\r\n\u2605 Train and level up your horse\u2019s stats to improve their performance\r\n\u2605 Buy and sell your star horses to create a stable of champions\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc34 <b>RIDE</b> \ud83d\udc34\r\n\u2605 Put your jumping skills to the test in Cross Country competitions\r\n\u2605 Bond with your animals by exploring your horse ranch in Free Roam\r\n\u2605 Capture beautiful images of horses and rider\r\n\u2605 Restore your family\u2019s horse racing legacy by completing exciting missions\r\n\r\nWhether you\u2019re a fan of derby racing, animal games or pet horses, your exciting horse simulation journey begins with Rival Stars Horse Racing.\r\n\r\nRival Stars Horse Racing is free to play but offers some game items for purchase with real money.\r\n\r\nTerms of Service: http://pikpok.com/terms-of-use/\r\n\r\nThe Star Riding Club subscription lasts for 1 Month and provides you with great daily in-game benefits. This subscription will auto-renew every month and must be cancelled at least 24 hours before renewal.",
    "descriptionHTML": "<font color=\"\u201dnavy\u201d\">Enjoy the ultimate horse racing and riding experience on mobile</font><br><br>\ud83c\udfc7 <b>RACE</b> \ud83c\udfc7<br>\u2605 Compete for glory in thrilling horse races<br>\u2605 Immersive racing gameplay with motion-captured animations and realistic commentary<br>\u2605 Team up with your friends and claim your place on the global leaderboard in live events<br>\u2605 Customize your jockey, silks, and helmets for a photo finish<br><br>\ud83e\uddec <b>BREED</b> \ud83e\uddec<br>\u2605 Breed adorable foals with unique coats and patterns<br>\u2605 Detailed genetic horse breeding system and distinct horse breeds<br>\u2605 Train and level up your horse\u2019s stats to improve their performance<br>\u2605 Buy and sell your star horses to create a stable of champions<br><br>\ud83d\udc34 <b>RIDE</b> \ud83d\udc34<br>\u2605 Put your jumping skills to the test in Cross Country competitions<br>\u2605 Bond with your animals by exploring your horse ranch in Free Roam<br>\u2605 Capture beautiful images of horses and rider<br>\u2605 Restore your family\u2019s horse racing legacy by completing exciting missions<br><br>Whether you\u2019re a fan of derby racing, animal games or pet horses, your exciting horse simulation journey begins with Rival Stars Horse Racing.<br><br>Rival Stars Horse Racing is free to play but offers some game items for purchase with real money.<br><br>Terms of Service: http://pikpok.com/terms-of-use/<br><br>The Star Riding Club subscription lasts for 1 Month and provides you with great daily in-game benefits. This subscription will auto-renew every month and must be cancelled at least 24 hours before renewal.",
